#X obj 631 8 conv.note2guido;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 121 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 The object converts a MIDI note number (pitch) with
a duration to a note written in GUIDO music notation. The result is
sent as a symbol from the outlet and can be fed to other objects such
as [proto.inscore] or score renderers. A pitch value less than 0 is
treated as a rest.;
